        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;After an expedition to a distant planet goes horribly wrong, Catra has to rescue her now-brainwashed wife from the eldritch horror that tore the planet to shreds. The problem is that sheâ€™s running out of time: the longer Adora stays under the creatureâ€™s control, the more of herself she loses, and itâ€™s only a matter of time before the creature gets Catra too.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
